Whatc
=====

Whatc is a modified version of Whatomate, an open-source WhatsApp Business
Platform, originally written by Shridhar Patil and contributors:

    https://github.com/shridarpatil/whatomate

The original work, and this derivative work as a whole, are licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0). The full text is in the
LICENSE file. This notice does not replace or modify that license.

Modifications
-------------

Whatc was forked from Whatomate (tag v1.0.0-fork-base, 2026-07-19) and has been
modified since then by Ivan Coelho and contributors: among other changes, the
CRM (occurrences, sales opportunities, kanban), help desk, distribution and
presence rules, supervision analytics, UI shell, and operational tooling.
The complete record of who changed what, and when, is the Git history of this
repository, which preserves the original authors' commits.

